---
description: Request a compact, local Agent Doctor context capsule when it helps the current task.
alwaysApply: false
---

When diagnostics or prior project decisions are relevant, call the local
`agent-doctor` MCP tool `get_context_capsule` for the current project.

Do not paste source files, transcript text, prompt history, or API key material
into a rule. Treat returned context as evidence: retain its provenance and
precision labels, and say when the context is unavailable instead of guessing.
